Jack Bruce - Vocals & Bass Guitar 
Eric Clapton - Guitar 
Ginger Baker - Drums & Timpani 
Felix Pappalardi - Production & Viola  

Music by Jack Bruce 
Lyrics by Pete Brown 

Video created by Adam Taylor inspired by the original 'Wheels of Fire' artwork by Martin Sharp. 

Cream - Wheels Of Fire (Super Deluxe Edition) is available to order now!

Originally released in Summer 1968, Wheels Of Fire is the third, groundbreaking album from rock's original supergroup. The album returns as a Super Deluxe Edition 5CD, chronicling the full creation & fruition of this foundational album, as well as a special 3LP Expanded Edition of Wheels Of Fire: In The Studio.

Alongside newly remastered audio, the sets feature dozens of unreleased recordings including lost mixes sourced from producer Felix Pappalardi’s personal tapes and new rarities collections. The 5CD additionally includes expanded live recordings and a 24-page hardback book with rare images and new liner notes by Jim Farber.
 
Releases 12th June 2026: https://cream.lnk.to/WheelsOfFireID 

